  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NORHED II iCARTA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">I-CARTA will set up mechanisms to institutionalise a set of previously tested interventions to improve the quality of research training and research to improve pubic and population health in Africa. The project seeks to produce high-quality early career researchers (ECRs) who grow into research leaders and enhance engagement between the CARTA community (ERC&#x2019;s, supervisors, graduates) and society to influence policy and programmatic change to improve long-term health outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
